# Ars Magica Fifth Edition, Legends of Hermes — Front Matter (Lore)

**Version:** 0.5.0
**Source:** Legends of Hermes (Atlas Games) — Ars Magica Fifth Edition, credits and Author Biographies (p. 2)
**Publisher:** Atlas Games

> The credits and Author Biographies, verbatim. The printed Contents and List of Inserts (pp. 3–7) are finding aids for
> the book’s own pages and are not converted — every unit they list is converted in its chapter. Page 1 is the cover,
> with no text; pp. 140–144 are advertisements, with no text layer.

